# NAME: Bybit Direct
# FORMAT: Surge RULE-SET (policy omitted)
# SOURCE: local gateway traffic observation, 2026-08-14 to 2026-08-18
# MIRROR: Graham-lo/surge
# UPDATED: 2026-08-18
# NOTE: Bybit endpoints that must bypass the proxy. ws2.bybit.biz resolves to Tencent
# Cloud and measured 17-21 ms direct against 85-99 ms through any proxy, the
# largest single saving in this profile. The spdtest hosts are the client's own
# route probes and must see the direct network to choose correctly. Reference
# this set with the DIRECT policy immediately before Bybit.list.

# Market data.
DOMAIN,ws2.bybit.biz

# Client-side route probes.
DOMAIN,spdtest-akm.byd3c3.com
DOMAIN,spdtest-teo.bynbc.com
DOMAIN,spdtest-ws.ng-dex.com
DOMAIN,spdtest-cft.ng-dex.com

# Domestic acceleration addresses.
IP-CIDR,43.135.121.179/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,43.154.61.67/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,43.160.158.108/32,no-resolve
